      "updated": 1784649209619,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "*** Non-functional requirements *** \n-- SSR vs CSR\n-- Response design (mobile/web -- prioritize web)\n-- Does not have realtime but illusion of real time?\n-- performance (reliability >> consistency)\n-- a11y, i18n\n-- observability\n==============================\n-- infinite scroll\n-- drag/drop tickets in real time\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "*** Non-functional requirements *** \n-- SSR vs CSR\n-- Response design (mobile/web -- prioritize web)\n-- Does not have realtime but illusion of real time?\n-- performance (reliability >> consistency)\n-- a11y, i18n\n-- observability\n==============================\n-- infinite scroll\n-- drag/drop tickets in real time\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
