      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784649935323,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "*** API *** (JWT contains user info)\n\n1. PUlling the current board\nGET /getBoard($input: GetBoardInput)\nGetBoardInput {\n   id: BoardID,\n   limit: Optional[Int]\n   page: Optional[Int]\n}\n\n2. Creating new tickets\nPOST /createTickets($input: CreateTicketInput)\nCreateTicketInput {title, points, boardID}\n\n3. Moving existing tickets\nPOST /transitionTicket($input: TicketTransactionInput)\nTicketTransactionInput {\n   boardID,\n   ticketID,\n   targetColumn\n}\n\n4. Creating new column\nPOST /createColumn($input: CreateColumnInput)\nCreateColumnInput {\n   boardID,\n   name\n}",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "*** API *** (JWT contains user info)\n\n1. PUlling the current board\nGET /getBoard($input: GetBoardInput)\nGetBoardInput {\n   id: BoardID,\n   limit: Optional[Int]\n   page: Optional[Int]\n}\n\n2. Creating new tickets\nPOST /createTickets($input: CreateTicketInput)\nCreateTicketInput {title, points, boardID}\n\n3. Moving existing tickets\nPOST /transitionTicket($input: TicketTransactionInput)\nTicketTransactionInput {\n   boardID,\n   ticketID,\n   targetColumn\n}\n\n4. Creating new column\nPOST /createColumn($input: CreateColumnInput)\nCreateColumnInput {\n   boardID,\n   name\n}",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
